⸻

ALSO PRESERVE THE PREVIOUS MOVEMENT/COMBO GOAL

This bounce system should work alongside ALVA’s desired fluid combat direction:

* responsive movement
* smooth aerial control
* momentum through attacks
* combat input buffering
* more accessible combos
* short intentional combo routes
* pursuit after launch

Do not interpret the bounce work as permission to introduce MultiVersus’s complete combat mechanics.

The reference game is still being used primarily for feel.

